---
title: "restart_policy (docker-compose.yml: bot service)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_running: container started
    q_running --> q_check_exit: process exits
    q_check_exit --> q_check_stop: exit detected
    q_check_stop --> q_restart: not manually stopped
    q_check_stop --> [*]: manually stopped (docker stop)
    q_restart --> q_running: restart container
    q_running --> q_running: healthy operation

    note right of q_check_stop
        INV-001: restart = unless-stopped means auto-restart on crash
        INV-002: manual docker stop is the only way to halt restarts
        INV-003: restart applies after daemon reboot unless manually stopped before reboot
    end note

    note right of q_restart
        INV-004: no restart backoff or limit defined (unbounded restart loop on persistent failure)
    end note
